1 NAME Erik Zakariasson /Esberg/
2 GIVN Erik Zakariasson
2 SURN Esberg
2 _MARNM Bergenskjöld
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 2 FEB 1699
2 ADDR
3 CITY Stockholm
3 STAE Uppland
3 CTRY Sweden
1 DEAT
2 DATE 5 MAY 1769
2 PLAC Vanbo
