1 NAME Samuel Gustaf /Hermelin/
2 GIVN Samuel Gustaf
2 _MARNM Hermelin
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 4 APR 1744
2 ADDR
3 CITY Stockholm
3 CTRY Sweden
