1 SEX M
1 BURI
2 PLAC Sankt Nicolai kyrka
2 ADDR
3 CITY Nyköping
3 CTRY Sweden
1 BIRT
2 DATE 25 JUL 1625
2 ADDR
3 CITY Nyköping
3 CTRY Sweden
1 DEAT
2 DATE 7 AUG 1697
