1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Due to the Swedish-Russian war Maria Rosenbröijer was forced to leave her home Saaris in Ingermanland around 1701. She fled to Turku, Finland, where her stepdaughter and 1. husbands niece Katarina Kremer was living
2 CONC .
