2 CONT - [Föredrag m. m.] (Conférence monétaire internationale, 1-2, avril-mai 1881, procesverbaux,Paris 1881, 4:o, passim; äv. på eng.: Proceedings of the international monetary conference. 1881, Cincinnati 1881,4:o). 
